<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (In 2025, BetterLife International Organization marked a defining year of growth, transitioning from programme expansion to regional scale, systems strengthening, and institutional leadership. Building on the foundations established in previous years, the organization deepened its work across Uganda, South Sudan, Tanzania, and Ghana while expanding its influence within regional and global climate and development spaces.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (Throughout the year, BetterLife focused on delivering integrated, community-driven solutions that address the interconnected challenges of climate change, food insecurity, and economic vulnerability. Particular emphasis was placed on strengthening refugee and host community livelihoods, advancing climate-smart agriculture, and scaling digital innovation through the Soilla platform.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (In total, the organization reached over 112,430 beneficiaries, with women, youth, and displaced populations at the centre of all programming. This growth reflects not only an increase in reach, but also a shift toward more sustainable, systems-based interventions that deliver long-term impact.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
