188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Recognizing the critical role of young people in driving climate action, BetterLife continued to invest in youth leadership and advocacy programmes throughout 2025.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Through structured training sessions, dialogues, and participation in national and international forums, young people were equipped with the skills and platforms needed to engage in climate policy and decision-making processes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (The organization facilitated over 60 youth dialogues and supported participation in major climate platforms, contributing to increased youth representation in climate governance spaces. These efforts ensured that the voices of young people, particularly those from vulnerable communities, were included in shaping climate solutions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
