195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (In 2025, the Soilla Smart Agriculture Platform emerged as a leader in digital innovation for climate-smart agriculture through BetterLife. It addressed smallholder farmers' need for timely, accurate, and localized information, offering insights on soil health, crop selection, weather, and markets. The platform onboarded 18,900 farmers, processed over 3.6 million data points, and sent more than 420,000 tailored advisory messages. This resulted in a 37% increase in crop yields and a 28% reduction in input costs, enhancing decision-making and resource use. Soilla's expansion signifies a major technological advancement in community-based climate solutions, paving the way for regional growth.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
